Query 2 — AVD Workforce Data

SEL 
fiscal_week_nbr AS "Fiscal Week",
dim_store AS Store,
rph_hrs_demand_adj AS "Rph Demand Hrs",
rph_hrs_act_adj AS "Rph Actual Hrs",
tech_hrs_demand_adj AS "Tech Demand Hrs",
tech_hrs_act_adj AS "Tech Actual Hrs"
FROM RXCOE_WFM.AVD_RX_FS
...

Purpose:
Extracts pharmacist (RPh) and technician (Tech) demand vs. actual hours by week.
Used to analyze labor efficiency and workforce optimization across retail stores.

