Query 5 — mTC Score

SEL * FROM rxcoe_sa.PK_Automation_mTC_Score;

Purpose:
Retrieves machine learning–based mTC (machine Telemetry/Throughput) Scores for automation systems — used to benchmark robot performance and reliability.

